    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "Here's the loop. It starts with a goal: fix the failing tests in this repo. Then a plan: read the errors, find the file, edit it, re-run. Then it acts, by calling tools: a terminal, a file editor, a browser, an API. Then it observes: it reads the output and decides what's next. And it repeats until it's done, or stuck. A well-built agent caps the loop with a step limit or a budget, so when it's stuck it stops and hands back to you. The model is the brain. The tools are the hands.",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "speed": 0.95,
      "estimated_duration_s": 28.8,
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "AgentLoopCycle",
          "props": {
            "title": "The Agent Loop",
            "handle": "@HumanitariansAI",
            "logo": "hai-wordmark-outlined.svg",
