    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "So what makes an agent background? Three things. It runs in the cloud, not in your chat window. It's asynchronous: you assign the task, close the laptop, and get a notification when it's done. And since nobody is watching, several can run at once: a code fix, a research report, a data cleanup, even a batch of game assets.",
