    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "Now the risks. Mistakes compound: one wrong step early, and every step after it builds on the error. Security: an agent with tools reads web pages and files, and malicious content can hide instructions in them. That's called prompt injection. Cost: long loops burn compute. And accountability: the agent doesn't sign off on anything. Someone still has to review the output.",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "speed": 0.95,
      "estimated_duration_s": 18.5,
