    {
      "beat_id": "B09",
      "act": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "So how do you use one well? Give it a clear, scoped goal, with a written definition of done. Limit its permissions to only the tools and access the task needs. That's least privilege. Require human review before anything ships. And treat it like a junior teammate: delegate, then check.",
